HistoryController --> StudyAgentFacade
AgentController --> StudyAgentFacade
CoursePilotCommand --> CliRunner
CliRunner --> StudyAgentFacade
StudyAgentFacade --> CourseService
StudyAgentFacade --> CourseMaterialService
StudyAgentFacade --> CourseSearchService
StudyAgentFacade --> GroundedQuestionService
StudyAgentFacade --> SummarizationService
StudyAgentFacade --> ConceptExtractionService
StudyAgentFacade --> FlashcardGenerationService
StudyAgentFacade --> FlashcardReviewService
StudyAgentFacade --> QuizGenerationService
StudyAgentFacade --> QuizAttemptService
StudyAgentFacade --> WrongAnswerExplanationService
StudyAgentFacade --> StudyPlanService
StudyAgentFacade --> RecommendationService
StudyAgentFacade --> LearningHistoryService
StudyAgentFacade --> AgentCoordinator
