AgentToolManager --> RecommendationService
AgentToolManager --> LearningHistoryService
GroundedQuestionService --> CourseSearchService
GroundedQuestionService --> GroundingContextBuilder
GroundedQuestionService --> PromptBuilder
GroundedQuestionService --> LlmClient
SummarizationService --> LlmClient
ConceptExtractionService --> LlmClient
FlashcardGenerationService --> GroundingContextBuilder
FlashcardGenerationService --> LlmClient
QuizGenerationService --> GroundingContextBuilder
QuizGenerationService --> LlmClient
WrongAnswerExplanationService --> LlmClient
